MultiLanguageItemData['en'][22219] = {name = "Plans: Jagged Obsidian Shield", additional_info = "Binds when picked up\nRequires Blacksmithing (300)\nRequiresCenarion Circle\n- Revered\n[q2]Use: Teaches you how to make a Jagged Obsidian Shield.\nSell Price: \n[q4]Jagged Obsidian Shield\nBinds when equipped\n{Off Hand} {Shield}\n3040 Armor\n63 Block\nDurability 120 / 120\nRequires Level 60\n[q2]Equip: Increases your block rating by 9.\n\n[q2]Equip: +5 All Resistances.\n\n[q2]Equip: When struck by a harmful spell, the caster of that spell has a 5% chance to be silenced for 3 sec. (Proc chance: 5%, 20s cooldown)\nSell Price: \nRequires Large Obsidian Shard (8), Small Obsidian Shard (24), Enchanted Thorium Bar (8), Essence of Earth (4)"}
